  "step_3": "The information relevant to the decision reason (expected values) is not considered by the individual. The individual focuses on the probability of winning, not on expected value. The decision reason’s rule — preferring the lottery with the higher expected value — is not reflected in the justification. Instead, the individual uses a different criterion (maximum probability of winning), which is not equivalent to evaluating expected value. Therefore, the individual did not use the decision reason based on expected value. There is no indication that they calculated or referenced expected values in their reasoning. The justification is inconsistent with the rule of the decision reason.",
  "final_assessment_score": 0
